msgctxt ""
"(qtdt-format) Please do not change the quotes (') and translate only the "
"content of the quotes."
msgid "hh 'Hours' mm 'Mins' ss 'Secs'"
msgstr "hh 'ម៉ោង' mm 'នាទី' ss 'វិនាទី'"

